      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Nobody before Day 1; at least eight others including the Matches by Day 1; the eleven ranked food suppliers by Day 1; exactly 40 on Day 14 including Nordhavn and 15+ European-style members; some never claim. Stop and report if the constraints cannot all hold."
    },
    {
      "id": "_scratch_pilot_preview_issues_01_claim_day_and_network_of_100_shares_my_trade_rule",
      "label": "Shared-trade rule for leads (sharesMyTrade)",
      "file_type": "rationale",
      "source_file": ".scratch/pilot-preview/issues/01-claim-day-and-network-of-100.md",
      "source_location": "L147",
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "The Daily Lead List and overnight attention draw only on Companies that buy what Kalayaan offers, sell what it seeks or sell the same; keeps the 60 new members out of its leads."
    },
    {
